WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:07.820
Why hello CZsWorld!

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.160
It's me, Jeff the Killer.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.740
I just came here to wish you a... Halloween.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.620
Your boy CZ, ha-ha, he's a little bit tied up at the moment.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:26.260
But don't worry. Cause I'll be uploading his new short film, Live Alone,

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.960
as soon as I can find it on this computer.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.880
But let's make one thing very clear CZsWorld.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.180
I'm in charge now!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.000
And on the menu for November...

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.060
...let's just say, PASTA.

